# Normalize all text files to LF line endings on checkin.
# Without this, contributors on different OSes/git configs (core.autocrlf)
# commit inconsistent CRLF/LF line endings, which bloats the largest
# documents in this repo (some 500KB-800KB+) and produces huge,
# unreviewable diffs whenever line endings flip instead of real content
# changes. Normalizing line endings keeps diffs, clones, and repo size
# focused on actual content changes.
* text=auto eol=lf
